#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "LMSCourse FSE is a fast, full-site editing WordPress theme tailored for online courses, coaching sites, and digital schools. Fully compatible with Masteriyo, LearnDash, Tutor LMS, and LifterLMS, it lets you launch a complete LMS site with lessons, quizzes, and certificates. Lightweight, responsive, and block-based, LMSCourse FSE works seamlessly with WooCommerce and payment gateways to help you sell and manage your online learning content."
msgstr ""

